             drive a whole calculation without building messages.
       [x] 75.2 Emits the WHOLE display on every accepted key, not just on "=",
             so the readout tracks the typing digit by digit: data.value (the
             number), data.output (display as text -- "12." mid-typing,
             "Error") and data.success.
       [x] 75.3 Error latch: divide by zero, or a result running to inf/NaN,
             sets pn_node_set_has_error(), emits success=FALSE, and then ignores
             every key but "C" WITH NO EMISSION -- the silent node is the error.
       [x] 75.4 Factory registration, help page PnCalcEngine.html, pipnode-nodes
             skill entry (filters-gate-compute.md).
